    "m_en": "Story cards (three per group), the feeling-words chart, the observation card (facilitator copy)",
    "a_en": "For a struggling group: offer two feeling words to choose between, instead of an open word.",
    "off_en": "Print the story cards in advance; after the briefing this needs no screen.",
    "s_en": "The stories are about imagined people, not anyone in the room. If a student ties a story to themselves and seems distressed, follow up privately.",
