    "i_en": "Take a weak sample plan and give two pieces of feedback in front of them: one that wounds the person, one that builds on the work with a next step. Ask: which would you accept if it were your plan? Then fix that “change” is one, never a list.",
    "off_en": "Write the four parts on the board."
